<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were fully steady in a lightly tested market. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Lot Choice 3 near 1300 lbs 66.50 with 1200 lbs heifer mates 66.50.  Lot Select and Choice 2-3 Holstein steers 61.50.</p>
</text>
